{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1124671-vtm-st-seeking-evil-cohorts","id":1124671,"title":"VtM ST Seeking Evil Cohorts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-04T02:33:53-07:00","id":1124671,"title":"VtM ST Seeking Evil Cohorts","content":"Hi. I'm currently running a Vampire: The Masquerade game through Skype called the Borderlands Chronicle. I'm expanding the game to include other canon settings and online platforms for deeper immersion for everyone, mostlyt via optional Twitter* and I'm in need of a competent** assistant GM(s) or those interested in playing characters connected to Canon npcs in a Skype game to get this more interactive version of the game going. I'm using the basic skeleton of the metaplot, though I've replaced or repurposed a few things to keep any contemporary WoD events uncertain in regards to their canonical backstory or explanation. <br /> <br /> Contact me through Private Message if interested in acting as an aST. Pm or post below if you're interested in playing as a PC in one of three cities: Chicago, New York or Baltimore.<br /> <br /> *I'm using the V20 &quot;Fangbook app&quot; for neonate and Anarch characters who would want it.<br /> <br /> **willing to accept and treat my version of things as canonical when in doubt","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-13-2017, 10:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"re