through real-time text chat. I do have solo sessions that come with the option of audio and video, if the player desires and it's not inconvenient, but group sessions and the majority of the game is text based.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-13-2017, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T18:19:33-07:00","id":1128655,"title":"","content":"Hey. <br /> <br /> I might be interested in playing as a PC in Baltimore.<br /> <br /> What are your expectations regarding meet-up times? And based on your OP, I assume you're doing V20?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T21:13:49-07:00","id":1128702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gentle_Rain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1124671-vtm-st-seeking-evil-cohorts?p=1128655#post1128655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey. <br /> <br /> I might be interested in playing as a PC in Baltimore.<br /> <br /> What are your expectations regarding meet-up times? And based on your OP, I assume you're doing V20?</div> </div> </div> </div>The plan is for two group sessions a month, along with a solo session for each character set between the events of the group sessions. Generally, Baltimore sessions will run between 3 and 5 hours. I'm generally in the habit of starting games between 2pm-4pm EST, but I'm not averse to later games at all. I'll be running Baltimore personally, so if you'd like further information on that setting, let me know. I should be posting up a thread for that setting in particular soon.<br /> <br /> My Co-ST will be running the Chicago setting, which should be recruiting within the next week or two, for those interested.<br /> <br /> As to the ruleset, V20 is the backbone of the game. However, some material from Dark Ages 20th is being used for fluff and some flexibility in Discipline choices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-14-2017, 12:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T21:36:08-07:00","id":1129107,"title":"","content":"This sounds great and really well organized on your part, which is always appreciated for this kind of thing. I'm really interested.<br /> <br /> Are the 2pm-4pm time slots on the weekend, or during the week? I'd prefer the former, and would have to think hard about committing to the latter.<br /> <br /> I can start re-reading the V20 Rulebook in preparation.<br /> <br /> Just for a little bit of background about myself as a prospective player, I've been interested in the White Wolf line of games and Vampire:The Masquerade in particular since roughly around middle school, but never really had the opportunity to play due to issues concerning location, work, school, etc. I've read through some of the core rulebooks, played Redemption and Bloodlines, and am familiar with the sects, clans, and Disciplines associated with the game. In other words, I've got a solid grasp of the basic setting associated with the game. I'd also say I've got a good handle on the character creation process.<br /> <br /> My knowledge might be a bit lacking when it comes to carrying out the mechanics associated with the game during the course of real-time play, but I'm sure I could learn from other players in order to pick them up fairly quickly.<br /> <br /> Best of luck, and I hope I get the chance to join in on your game.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain",