uld learn from other players in order to pick them up fairly quickly.<br /> <br /> Best of luck, and I hope I get the chance to join in on your game.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I'm glad you're interested, and I can assure you that your experience level is more than enough to get into the game without missing a step. I'm still readying materials for Baltimore, but the game is polished enough for me to tell you that it's an updated version of the classic Anarchs vs Camarilla type of game, with all the Clans traditionally associated with those Sects open to players.<br /> <br /> My ideal days to run this would be Fridays or Saturdays, which I hope fits with your weekend scheduling preference. My other games are usually played on weekdays, leaving my schedule open on Friday, Saturday and sometimes Sunday. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-15-2017, 07:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T08:34:30-07:00","id":1129246,"title":"","content":"Sent you PM<br /> <br /> I wish to be part of this. For moment here thought it was going to be Sabbat/ Anarch but Cammy is just as good.<br /> <br /> If its V20, am experienced in it but rusty due to lack of playing.<br /> <br /> I hope to hear from you soon about more details","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1202-negzero","name":"negZero","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T11:17:20-07:00","id":1129309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>negZero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1124671-vtm-st-seeking-evil-cohorts?p=1129246#post1129246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sent you PM<br /> <br /> I wish to be part of this. For moment here thought it was going to be Sabbat/ Anarch but Cammy is just as good.<br /> <br /> If its V20, am experienced in it but rusty due to lack of playing.<br /> <br /> I hope to hear from you soon about more details</div> </div> </div> </div>You were interested in the Chicago setting, right? I'm only overseeing that game, and my Co-ST has yet to begin recruiting for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Sal