er/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T13:00:26-07:00","id":1130934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gentle_Rain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1124671-vtm-st-seeking-evil-cohorts?p=1130903#post1130903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is anything scheduled for this Saturday?<br /> <br /> Should I be making a character or something similar?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's nothing scheduled for the game at this point. Unfortunately, I'm going to postpone any player recruitment for the game temporarily, as I'm currently dealing with a back injury that occurred earlier this week. The game isn't cancelled and recruitment threads will still be posted once I'm well enough to get things back on the rails.<br /> <br /> My apologies! If you're still interested, stay tuned for further updates. This is just a setback.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-22T18:01:07-07:00","id":1132867,"title":"","content":"Okay. Staying tuned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-22T23:08:51-07:00","id":1132930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gentle_Rain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1124671-vtm-st-seeking-evil-cohorts?p=1132867#post1132867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay. Staying tuned.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm still physically out of commission, but I thought it might be helpful to mention that the currently running game set in New Mexico might need 1 or 2 new players to flesh out a neonate coterie. Baltimore and Chicago settings forthcoming.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1005862-the-borderlands-actual-play\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...ds-actual-play</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-23-2017, 02:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T07:45:36-07:00","id":1133368,"title":"","content":"Okay.<br /> <br /> I'm not in any hurry, and am interested in the Baltimore campaign, so I'll just hang tight. Let me know if I should be doing anything regarding character creation or the like, and I'll let you know if anything changes on my end. I may be moving across the country for a new job here shortly, but my interest in your campaign remains.<br /> <br /> I'll stay in touch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T03:59:32-07:00","id":1133724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gentle_Rain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1124671-vtm-st-seeking-evil-cohorts?p=1133368#post1133368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay.<br /> <br /> Let me know if I should be doing anything regarding character creation or the like, and I'll let you know if anything changes on my end. I may be moving across the country for a new job here shortly, but my interest in your campaign remains.<br /> <br /> I'll stay in touch.</div> </div> </div> </div>Character concepts wouldn't be too early to think about. Here's a few solid facts about the setting that should help with that:<br /> <br /> - The game is set in 2017, so contemporary technology, entertainment etc is the norm.<br /> - Sect control over the city is up for grabs, and the Camarilla (local leadership based out of Virginia and Washington) are contending with would-be Anarch Barons and the occasional Sabbat raid. <br /> - For the Camarilla, all 7 pillar Clans are playable, along with the Mariner Gangrel bloodline. Malkavians here generally come with Dominate in-Clan. <br /> - The Anarchs have a slightly wider playable Clan spread, adding Lasombra Antitribu, Ravnos and Caitiff options to that list.<br /> - PC's can range in vampiric age a bit, from recently Embraced fledglings transitioning into being fully released neonates all the way to Kindred who've been unliving and independent of their sire since the 1980s.<br /> <br /> You can contact me to chat further about the game through Skype. My handle is morningsidekiller1<br /> <br /> I'm glad the game's gotten your interest and hope to hear from you when you get the chance. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> - Az","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-25-2017, 07:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T20:13:00-07:00","id":1134724,"title":"","content":"Sure! No problem.<br /> <br /> I'm going to sit down in earnest next weekend to create the first draft of a character, set up a Skype account for the express purpose of playing the game, etc. I should be in touch then.<br /> <br /> For what it's worth, I'm absolutely certain that I'll be playing a Camarilla character. No present ideas regarding generation just yet, but clan would either be Brujah, Gangrel, Nosferatu, or Toreador. I realize that's actually a fairly large spread of possibilities, but it at least gives us both some notion of what I'll be playing. This will be my first real VtM game, after years of familiarity with the source material and various computer games associated with the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13431-gentle_rain","name":"Gentle_Rain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}